  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1401.20 Homemade ride or device",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1401.20 “Homemade ride or device” means a carnival or amusement ride that was not manufactured by a recognized manufacturer or any carnival or amusement ride which has been altered without the approval of the manufacturer.\n\nSource. #7618, eff 12-28-01; ss by #8342, eff 4-28-05, EXPIRED: 1-2-14 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)\n\nNew. #10507, eff 1-21-14; renumbered by #13535, INTERIM (formerly Saf-C 1401.121); EXPIRED: 1-21-24\n\nNew. #13984, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-24-24, EXPIRED: 11-20-24\n\nNew. #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (formerly Saf-C 1401.16) (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
